She went to Sharif University of Technology for studying mechanical engineering, then came to Berkeley, got her PhD in mechanical engineering.

11
00:01:08,580 --> 00:01:14,680
Post -doc at Stanford and AeroAstro, then she went to be an assistant professor at UIUC.

12
