Now she's back at UC Berkeley as one of our wonderful colleagues in the mechanical engineering department and we love having her back.

13
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:29,860
And she is one of almost every major award you could get as a junior faculty member and she's got the ONR Young Investigator,

14
